悲鳴って…今日は無いよ、多分お主ら。ごめんね？
Screams...? There probably won't be any today, you guys. Sorry, okay?

11
00:02:41,850 --> 00:02:45,900
お主らには悪いけど、今日わし多分悲鳴ないわ。
Sorry to say, but I probably won't be screaming today.

12
